OL,3,GNEWSANightclub security guard struck by
OL,4,Aball bearing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA security guard has been struck in the
OL,7,Fchest after ball bearings were fired
OL,8,Foutside a nightclub in Kent, police
OL,9,Fsay.
OL,11,FAt about 01:00 GMT on Saturday, a
OL,12,Fdark-coloured car with no front
OL,13,Fregistration plate stopped outside a
OL,14,Fclub in Church Road in Tunbridge Wells,
OL,15,Fthe force said.
OL,17,FPeople inside the car reportedly fired
OL,18,Fball bearings at the building and a
OL,19,Fguard was hit. No injuries were
OL,20,Freported, police said.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
