OL,3,GNEWSANightclub security guard struck by
OL,4,Aball bearing
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police said the suspected vehicle
OL,7,Fleft in the direction of Mount Pleasant
OL,8,FRoad and later a car showroom in London
OL,9,FRoad was hit and had its windows
OL,10,Fdamaged.
